      "title": "Add DGLD Token to Base",
      "author": "TonyBarroca77",
      "number": 1279,
      "body": "**Summary**\r\n\r\nThis PR is to add the Digital Gold Token (DGLD) to the Superchain token list for Base.\r\nDGLD is an ERC-20 gold backed token offering direct, legally enforceable ownership of physical PAMP gold held in secured vaults in Switzerland.\r\n\r\n- name: DGLD\r\n- symbol: DGLD\r\n- Network: Base\r\n- decimals: 18\r\n- website: https://dgld.ch/\r\n- twitter: @DGLD_Official\r\n- Etherscan: https://etherscan.io/address/0xA9299C296d7830A99414d1E5546F5171fA01E9c8\r\n- Basescan: https://basescan.org/address/0xd02f50E1017F493ffFFa70c8fCf09e349e11d6c9\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
